ildings, retail centers, medical office facilities, and residential lot developments; and consumer loans. In addition, the company offers other financial services, such as internet banking, wire transfers, electronic bill payment and presentment, funds transfer and other digital payment offerings, lock box services, courier, and cash management services. Further, the company holds certain investment securities, municipal and non-profit loans, and leases; invests primarily in low-income housing tax credits and small business investment corporations; and certain real estate loans and related securities. Western Alliance Bancorporation was founded in 1994 and is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona.","employees":3769,"website":"https://www.westernalliancebancorporation.com","country":"United States","city":"Phoenix","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Kenneth A. Vecchione","title":"Chairman, President & CEO"},{"name":"Mr. Timothy W. Boothe","title":"Chief Administration Officer"},{"name":"Mr. Timothy R. Bruckner","title":"Chief Banking Officer For Regional Banking"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.61,"tpe":12.66,"ps":3.433,"pfcf":11.64,"peg":1.31,"pb":1.605,"ev_ebitda":10.53,"rev_growth":0.106,"eps_growth":0.16,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1329,"eps_growth_next":0.1099,"div_yield":0.02175,"roe":0.1268,"roa":0.01564,"de":54.45,"gross_margin":0.2391,"op_margin":0.3554,"profit_margin":0.2541,"current_ratio":1.509},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":7.116,"sector":10.61,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":8.47,"sector":12.66,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":2.339,"sector":3.433,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":11.64,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.47,"sector":1.31,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":1.107,"sector":1.605,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":null,"sector":54.45,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Re